OL,3,GNEWSADrought halts Cambridge
OL,4,AUniversity's apple day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has cancelled its annual
OL,7,Fapple day due to low harvests caused by
OL,8,Fthis summer's drought.
OL,10,FCambridge University Botanic Garden was
OL,11,Fdue to hold the event on 18 October,
OL,12,Fand said it was "devastated" to have to
OL,13,Fcancel it.
OL,15,FWriting on Facebook, staff said: "Due
OL,16,Fto this summer's drought, the apple
OL,17,Fharvests have been so low that we have
OL,18,Fbeen unable to source enough quantities
OL,19,Fof heritage apples to make the event
OL,20,Fviable."
